Third-party components
----------------------

None. Oracle has no third-party dependency and no CDN.

Vendored from this project's own kits (same licence, same author), copied verbatim
on 25/11/2026:

- web-kit 0.1.0 — docs/play/web-kit.js — the offline shell, storage helpers and PWA registration
- export-kit 1.0.0 — docs/play/export-kit.js — Blob download, used to write the export

Neither kit is modified. Neither makes a network request.

On face detection
-----------------

The portrait oracle uses the browser's own `FaceDetector` when the browser has one, and
only to answer a yes/no question: is there a face in this image at all. It never identifies
anyone. Where the browser has no detector, the app says so in plain words and reads only
colour, light and composition — which is all it ever reads.
